{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年59歲的昔日港姐亞軍吳婉芳，憑藉數十年如一日的少女外貌，一向被外界封為「凍齡女神」。</p><p>近年她不僅保養得宜，家中更是喜事重重。</p><p>繼今年5月二仔胡智同低調成家立室後，其長子胡智略與富三代霍詠盈（Caroline）近日亦迎來結婚5周年紀念日。</p><p>向來</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:23:57.029076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T12:01:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T12:17:16.710345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:17:16.710345+00:00","content_hash":"72b8860d29c7936a103e2262fdeaf91b3b1e493f6a65c782e96240ba200e73bf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}